WEBVTT

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:26.120
<i>How many of those starry 
fantasies have been forgotten</i>

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:31.720
<i>The old dreams no longer shine</i>

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:37.470
<i>The paths that we have walked 
together are precious treasures</i>

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:43.340
<i>Nothing can hold us back</i>

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:48.720
<i>I won't be afraid how long it is tonight</i>

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:54.050
<i>As long as you stand by my side</i>

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:57.930
<i>Pierce the night sky like 
the first glow of dawn</i>

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.520
<i>And try my best to light the earth</i>

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:03.070
<i>Break through the chains of fate</i>

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.340
<i>No dodge</i>

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:05.510
<i>No surrender</i>

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:09.060
<i>On the battlefield your gaze empowers me</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:11.990
<i>No fear to embrace hope</i>

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:17.850
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:23.930
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:32.270
<b>Episode Eleven
The Last Summoner, Season 1, Part 1</b>

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:36.400
Only newbies eat the Furnace Hotel's food.

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:42.020
They don't even know that the 
trials have already begun.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:44.210
That's right.

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:48.390
This floor's boss is the 
world's top-ranked trap master.

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:52.930
He's adept at various methods of hunting 
and takes pleasure in tormenting contestants.

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:57.830
I remember one time 
when he poisoned the food,

00:01:57.830 --> 00:02:01.040
causing hundreds of people to quit the 
competition with vomiting and diarrhea.

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:02.270
It was spectacular!

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:04.580
There was another classic of his, too.

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:07.380
He hid numerous giant leeches in the bath.

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:11.600
What a beautiful image!

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:15.100
Help! Let me go!

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:22.940
Miaowu is really scared of water.

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:29.560
Ah Jie, why are you sitting in the 
water without changing your clothes?

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:31.530
I'm only 16 years old.

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:37.560
It's not like I'm used to bathing with cat-
girl spirits and cross-dressers or anything.

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:43.680
You tsundere!

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:45.640
Attack!

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:49.060
Holy Shield!

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:52.060
<i>Welcome to the Furnace Arena TV!</i>

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:52.060
Ah Jie!

00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:55.300
Stop for a moment and look at this!

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:03.090
<i>This is Bonnie, bringing you the 
highlights from this season's arena.</i>

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:07.370
<i>Meet the MVP: Hana!</i>

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:09.720
Summoned Spirit: Man-Eating Flower

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:09.720
<i>Her summoned spirit is the 
man-eating flower, Greenball!</i>

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:11.060
What?!

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:14.450
<i>Hana, who comes from nobility</i>

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:18.120
<i>and wields the power of plant summoning,</i>

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:20.770
<i>is the first to make it to the 11th floor.</i>

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:25.970
<i>Her outstanding performance makes her 
the season's brightest star!</i>

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:29.750
<i>What's more, many people 
idolize her as a goddess!</i>

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:34.660
<i>What surprises will she 
bring us in the next round?</i>

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:36.980
<i>Please wait and see!</i>

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:40.130
<i>Stay tuned to Furnace TV for more!</i>

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:42.870
Great!

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:45.060
Hana's in the Furnace too!

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:47.770
What a fascinating girl!

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:50.010
She's already way ahead.

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:54.500
We need to do our best, too!

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:58.580
Now I'm really motivated!

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:00.050
Let's go!

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:03.170
Tomorrow...

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:05.720
We're gonna win!

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:07.830
Let's get an early night, then.

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:09.620
Until tomorrow!

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:10.890
See you tomorrow meowning!

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:15.410
The newbies have gone back 
to sleep in their rooms.

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:18.430
Only the veterans will 
be waiting in the lobby.

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:23.500
The show's about to begin.

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:38.770
What's that sound?

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:57.300
It's so noisy... Who's doing renovations 
in the middle of the night?

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:03.470
Let's get out of here!

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:06.810
The door's locked!

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.270
The window's also been sealed shut!

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:22.430
Looks like my ancient cleavers 
are the only option left.

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:28.100
Get out of my way, Ah Jie!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.000
I'm chopping it down!

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.390
Chop! Chop! Chop! Chop!

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:40.390
My hands are numb, 
and it's not even scratched!

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:41.950
It's not normal metal.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:45.600
This whole room is a special trap.

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:50.270
Knight's Lance!

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:54.680
Great Sword!

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:58.060
Neither's any good!

00:05:58.450 --> 00:05:59.110
Quiet...

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:00.580
Let me think.

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:03.340
We're out of time!

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:05.620
Dora!

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:09.090
Can't you summon any weapon or tool you want?

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:12.350
I'm hoping you can conjure up...

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:15.550
a skeleton key!

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:31.750
Looks like all the rooms have been hit.

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:33.910
Crap.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:35.420
We need to find Miaowu and Stan, fast.

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:39.430
Miaowu's room is up ahead!

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:45.930
What a huge cockroach!

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:50.270
Step on it! Step on it! Step on it!

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:52.470
D-Don't step on me!

00:06:58.100 --> 00:06:59.500
That was close.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:02.470
I turned into a cockroach in order to escape.

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:09.460
More people are escaping.

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:38.750
Looks like most of them got out.

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:42.770
Where's Stan?

00:07:43.340 --> 00:07:43.870
Oh...

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:44.970
...no!

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:48.040
Please don't tell me...

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:49.970
that this is his room...

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:52.000
Stan!

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:54.790
You might be only 140 cm tall, 
nerdy, and weird,

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:58.640
but I really hope that 
nothing's happened to you!

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:08.790
Confession received!

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:11.770
Those vents are way too dark. 
Took me forever to crawl here.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:19.920
Hey, that tickles!

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:23.430
<i>Contestants!</i>

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:27.330
<i>It's an honor to meet you all 
on this fascinating evening.</i>

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:30.800
<i>I am the boss of the 
Demon Furnace's first floor.</i>

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:37.100
<i>As previously announced, the first 
knockout round has begun on schedule.</i>

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:40.520
You liar! Didn't you say 
that it'd start tomorrow?

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:44.140
Fool! It's already past midnight!

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:48.540
<i>The rules of this round are very simple:</i>

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.000
<i>There are no rules!</i>

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.580
<i>You need only satisfy 
one condition to win:</i>

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:55.920
<i>Leave the hotel alive!</i>

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:58.360
<i>Your time is limited,</i>

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:00.620
<i>so you'd better hurry up!</i>

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:02.750
Run! It's coming!

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:10.720
The entire hotel is a trap!

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:16.830
Damn! This again?!

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:18.340
How about some creativity?

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.220
The lobby's just ahead!

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:23.350
It should be safer there!

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:38.680
What?!

00:09:43.010 --> 00:09:45.680
Save me! I have a wife and kids!

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:52.970
Drop dead! I don't even have a girlfriend!

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:58.930
Get out of here! The floor's collapsing fast!

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:01.840
Oh my God! Help me!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:04.050
Stan!

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:30.940
A little... too heavy!

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:31.740
Hold tight, you guys!

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:38.950
The Holy Mother of the White Lotus...

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:41.680
No matter how many times you save the weak,

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:45.470
they will always fall elsewhere.

00:10:45.730 --> 00:10:49.960
The night of madness has only just... begun!

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:53.450
Let's party!

00:10:57.960 --> 00:11:01.290
Mommy, I wanna go home!

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:03.430
Someone, save me! 
I'll pay as much as you want!

00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:19.850
How many levels are in here?

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:24.890
I suspect that this murder hotel 
doesn't actually have an exit.

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:29.890
<b>Front Exit</b>

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:32.390
<b>Liar! Beware!</b>

00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:35.120
There are lots of little notes on the wall.

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:37.960
They were probably left by 
the previous contestants.

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:41.770
<b>Treasure Chest Inside</b>

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:41.770
<b>Beware of Bombs</b>

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:41.770
<b>Boss Ahead</b>

00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:45.410
There are so many messages. 
Which ones are true?

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:51.500
I've been tricked so many times 
that I don't trust anyone anymore.

00:11:56.910 --> 00:11:58.750
In any case, if there's no way out...

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:21.470
Congratulations for passing 
the first floor's trial.

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:24.560
I'm Renault, this floor's boss.

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:30.620
In this knockout round, 30 passed,

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:34.040
49 were severely injured, and 13 died.

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:36.050
Very good, everyone!

00:12:45.600 --> 00:12:47.500
Damn him! Beat him up!

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:49.270
This lunatic!

00:12:49.270 --> 00:12:51.060
Inhuman scumbag!

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:21.790
A friendly reminder.

00:13:21.790 --> 00:13:24.500
It's not against the rules to kill 
the boss in the Demon Furnace,

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:26.890
so you're welcome to try!

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:34.480
Okay, next up is the most exciting part!

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:47.820
Every contestant gets a wooden treasure 
chest as a reward for passing this floor.

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:50.720
There's a chance of getting a weapon.

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:53.470
Why not try your luck? Don't delay!

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:57.310
You wanna kill us with this stuff?

00:14:01.970 --> 00:14:03.140
Treasure chest opening time!

00:14:03.140 --> 00:14:04.770
What a beautiful sight!

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:09.580
Three Crystal Shards and one Saffron Ring.

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:11.470
Looks good to me.

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:15.420
30,000 Furnace Dollars 
and half a Rough Diamond.

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:18.120
Not bad, I guess.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.620
That's pretty good!

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:23.310
I only got a mismatched pair 
of old leather boots.

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:28.300
Stan, why haven't you opened your box yet?

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:33.930
Please, please, please, please...

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:36.630
Opening 'er up!

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:45.600
What...

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:48.560
What the hell?!

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:49.970
Bingo!

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:52.310
Finally, someone hit the jackpot!

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:54.950
This is what I've meticulously 
prepared for you,

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:58.090
the ticket to the Demon 
Furnace's second floor!

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:01.220
Good luck!

00:15:01.220 --> 00:15:02.550
Holy Shield!

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:11.800
The Furnace Hotel never closes. 
We look forward to your next visit!

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:23.540
It hurts!

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:27.100
It's so dark! Did we fall into hell?

00:15:30.410 --> 00:15:34.270
Welcome to the second floor 
of the Demon Furnace.

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:36.770
It's a ghost!

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:49.660
Seeing as everyone is still 
stressed from the previous level,

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:53.020
I thought a little joke might 
help you all relax a bit.

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:55.630
This isn't funny at all, okay?

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:57.790
Relax!

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:02.880
That crazy boss and his traps from the 
previous level are ancient history now.

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:06.230
From now on, it's fair play all the way,

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:11.140
because the boss of the 
second floor is me, Bonnie!

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:15.350
Getting back on track, the next trial is...

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:16.890
a race!

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:39.180
I never expected the second floor 
to be a giant race track.

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:42.710
There aren't many restrictions 
within the rules.

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:44.600
Only 20 laps around the track are needed.

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:47.800
The first 15 contestants 
to the finishing line win.

00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:52.760
Fair and simple, right?

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:58.040
Furthermore, this race will be 
broadcast live on Furnace TV,

00:16:58.040 --> 00:17:00.000
commentated by me, 
the one and only Bonnie.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.070
Good luck, everyone!

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:04.590
<i>Perfect.</i>

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:08.230
<i>This way, Dad and Hana might see us.</i>

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:12.730
I'll give you five minutes to warm up. 
The race will start after that.

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:26.390
If there's one thing I'm 
confident about, it's my speed.

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:31.930
My wings will leave you all in the dust!

00:17:33.670 --> 00:17:34.510
Wait...

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:36.870
What about you, Stan?

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:39.010
There are no cars or planes in here.

00:17:39.460 --> 00:17:42.390
No problem! I'll come up with something.

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:43.040
In fact,

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:46.310
I'll take first place!

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:49.620
Not if I can help it!

00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:51.100
Last one there's a puppy!

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:58.810
How arrogant of them to ignore us veterans.

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:03.850
As repeat challengers, 
we have prepared...

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:06.350
a secret weapon!

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:15.290
Us old drivers will win!

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:16.680
It's already decided!

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:23.300
All contestants are in position.

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:25.100
The race is about to start!

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:35.580
Counting down!

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:37.730
Three, two, one...

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:38.930
Go!

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:09.250
What a strong smell.

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:11.970
Have you really decided to wake it up?

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:14.000
Of course.

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:19.830
This is the best gift 
I can bestow upon Ah Jie.

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:45.390
<i>Sit with you watching the night sky</i>

00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:50.630
<i>Vast stars reflect in our eyes</i>

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:58.220
<i>Like thousands of tiny wishes in our hearts</i>

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:03.740
<i>Longing to discover the origin of the 
mysterious everlasting ancient world</i>

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:08.730
<i>The past and the present are 
linked in a fantastic instant</i>

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:13.730
<i>Watch over our beautiful 
home against evil forever</i>

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:18.720
<i>The blazing sun is our inevitable 
cruel test of growth</i>

00:20:18.720 --> 00:20:23.770
<i>May we return from thorny 
paths still being young</i>

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:28.770
<i>With love and hate, laughter and 
tears, compose every touching moment</i>

00:20:28.770 --> 00:20:33.730
<i>Five friends shoulder to shoulder, 
friendship will last until eternity</i>

00:20:33.730 --> 00:20:41.180
<i>With you tomorrow must 
be full of shining hopes</i>

00:20:41.180 --> 00:20:46.330
<i>Our tomorrow</i>
